		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://drownedmadonna.com/?p=4188</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[<p>Access Hollywood’s Shaun Robinson interviewed Madonna on the red carpet at the Grammy Awards, and asked about Taylor Swift, and [...]</p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/taylor-swift-madonna-means-much/20150211">Taylor Swift: &#8220;Madonna means too much to me.&#8221;</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna news new album Rebel Heart</a>.</p>
]]></description>
				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><strong>Access Hollywood</strong>’s Shaun Robinson interviewed <strong>Madonna</strong> on the red carpet at the <strong>Grammy Awards</strong>, and asked about <strong>Taylor Swift</strong>, and Madonna said very nice things about Taylor:</p>
<blockquote><p>She writes some damn catchy pop songs. Can’t get them out of my head.<br />
My favourite? [Shake it off] is a good one.<br />
The one where she growls in the middle. She gets kind of crazy!</p></blockquote>
<p><object id="flashObj" width="480" height="270" classid="clsid:D27CDB6E-AE6D-11cf-96B8-444553540000" codebase="http://download.macromedia.com/pub/shockwave/cabs/flash/swflash.cab#version=9,0,47,0"><param name="movie" value="http://c.brightcove.com/services/viewer/federated_f9?isVid=1&amp;isUI=1" /><param name="bgcolor" value="#FFFFFF" /><param name="flashVars" value="videoId=4039456471001&amp;playerID=1490276379001&amp;playerKey=AQ~~,AAABAY6g5IE~,g0_gr83Y4h2gsONEuiYgmhMw_6Z52KwP&amp;domain=embed&amp;dynamicStreaming=true" /><param name="base" value="http://admin.brightcove.com" /><param name="seamlesstabbing" value="false" /><param name="allowFullScreen" value="true" /><param name="swLiveConnect" value="true" /><param name="allowScriptAccess" value="always" /><embed src="http://c.brightcove.com/services/viewer/federated_f9?isVid=1&amp;isUI=1" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" flashvars="videoId=4039456471001&amp;playerID=1490276379001&amp;playerKey=AQ~~,AAABAY6g5IE~,g0_gr83Y4h2gsONEuiYgmhMw_6Z52KwP&amp;domain=embed&amp;dynamicStreaming=true" base="http://admin.brightcove.com" name="flashObj" width="480" height="270" seamlesstabbing="false" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen" allowscriptaccess="always" swliveconnect="true" pluginspage="http://www.macromedia.com/shockwave/download/index.cgi?P1_Prod_Version=ShockwaveFlash" /></object></p>
<p>Some minutes later, Robinson interviewed Taylor Swift and she was crazy about Madonna words:</p>
<p>Shaun Robinson: <em>I was interviewing Madonna a few minutes ago. She said some really nice things about you.</em><br />
Taylor Swift: <em>Stop, I will pass out! You can’t. Don’t be lying.</em><br />
SR: <em>She said you’re so talented. She loves you.</em><br />
TS:</p>
<blockquote><p>Oh my God, I’ve been so scared to meet her, because it means too much to me. When she first said something nice about me in the press a couple of weeks ago. I was like “There&#8217;s no way it’s real. It’s too good to be real. Cause we&#8217;re like &#8216;Who&#8217;s your favourite pop artist?&#8217; and she said me, and I was like (freaking out face), I can&#8217;t prove that it happened, there was no video of it&#8230; And what else she said?</p></blockquote>
<p><object id="flashObj" width="480" height="270" classid="clsid:D27CDB6E-AE6D-11cf-96B8-444553540000" codebase="http://download.macromedia.com/pub/shockwave/cabs/flash/swflash.cab#version=9,0,47,0"><param name="movie" value="http://c.brightcove.com/services/viewer/federated_f9?isVid=1&amp;isUI=1" /><param name="bgcolor" value="#FFFFFF" /><param name="flashVars" value="videoId=4039581062001&amp;playerID=1490276379001&amp;playerKey=AQ~~,AAABAY6g5IE~,g0_gr83Y4h2gsONEuiYgmhMw_6Z52KwP&amp;domain=embed&amp;dynamicStreaming=true" /><param name="base" value="http://admin.brightcove.com" /><param name="seamlesstabbing" value="false" /><param name="allowFullScreen" value="true" /><param name="swLiveConnect" value="true" /><param name="allowScriptAccess" value="always" /><embed src="http://c.brightcove.com/services/viewer/federated_f9?isVid=1&amp;isUI=1" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" flashvars="videoId=4039581062001&amp;playerID=1490276379001&amp;playerKey=AQ~~,AAABAY6g5IE~,g0_gr83Y4h2gsONEuiYgmhMw_6Z52KwP&amp;domain=embed&amp;dynamicStreaming=true" base="http://admin.brightcove.com" name="flashObj" width="480" height="270" seamlesstabbing="false" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen" allowscriptaccess="always" swliveconnect="true" pluginspage="http://www.macromedia.com/shockwave/download/index.cgi?P1_Prod_Version=ShockwaveFlash" /></object></p>
